  "details": "Because of [this feedback](https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/local-only-contacts-should-not-affect-performance-rank), local only contacts no longer affects performance rank. But when non-local contacts exceeds very poor limit (16 contacts) on mobile, ALL contacts are removed even they are local only. Because it doesn't affect performance rank, I think it's fair not to remove local only contacts in order to keep avatar functionality.",
